## Hints

- E2: ratio of variances = 1 − ρ² scaled... work it out: Var(A−B) =
  sA²+sB²−2ρsAsB vs sA²+sB². The dividend is the covariance term.
- E3: for the mean, returns' own ACF is what matters (≈0) — the |r| ACF
  matters for the SD/Sharpe. Compute both, use the right one for each.
